1209121405\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Altar7.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121405\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"133\" height=\"68\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Altar7.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar7.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Altar7.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121405\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Altar7.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Gizmo's Observatory</a></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>Use the lab card to open the passage<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121559\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"use lab card\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"142\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Use lab card.png\" data-image-key=\"Use_lab_card.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121559\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121559\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"use lab card\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121559\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"142\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Use lab card.png\" data-image-key=\"Use_lab_card.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3b/Use_lab_card.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121559\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Use_lab_card.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">use lab card</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121640\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Altar7Look\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"125\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Altar7Look.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar7Look.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121640\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209121640\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Altar7Look\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"125\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Altar7Look.png\" data-image-key=\"Altar7Look.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fa/Altar7Look.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209121640\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Altar7Look.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Go to the final location. Melt the ice above the huge ice block to open the entrance, and place <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a> into the last one.\n<ol><li>Closest entry, burn the ice with <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a>, then go straight until you see a rock cover with ice stuck at the ceiling.<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 167px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Closest entry\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"167\" height=\"136\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Closest entry.png\" data-image-key=\"Closest_entry.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Closest entry\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"167\" height=\"136\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Closest entry.png\" data-image-key=\"Closest_entry.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Closest_entry.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122406\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Closest_entry.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>Keep looking to your right and ceiling to locate the rock. Then jump on the ice on the right ice wall, after jump to the highest point, use <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a> to burn the ice that covers the rock. After the ice melt, jump down in to the broken hole.<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122520\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"GoAltar8\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"118\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"GoAltar8.png\" data-image-key=\"GoAltar8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209122520\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209122520\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"GoAltar8\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209122520\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"118\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"GoAltar8.png\" data-image-key=\"GoAltar8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/GoAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251209122520\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:GoAltar8.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>After jump down the hole, you can use <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> to run faster. Use the <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a> for the last ice, then use the 8th <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a>. If done successfully, the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">DESTROYER OF WORLDS</strong> will spawn after the final ice is melt.<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 300px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209123135\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"After activating 7\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"InAltar8.png\" data-image-key=\"InAltar8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20251209123135\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest?cb=20251209123135\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"After activating 7\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20251209123135\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"InAltar8.png\" data-image-key=\"InAltar8.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/InAltar8.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20251209123135\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:InAltar8.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><b>After activating 7</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ol></li></ol></li>\n<li>Take your <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">D